<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">12072026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>United States Central Command struck about a hundred and forty targets along Iran's coast, and Tehran has now declared the Strait of Hormuz closed until further notice.</s> <s>That passage carried a fifth of the world's oil before this war, and missile alerts have sounded across Bahrain, Qatar, and the Emirates.</s> <s>The Gulf states hosting American bases are the ones most exposed to a war they did not start.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>In Pakistan-administered Kashmir, one man was killed as police moved to reopen a road near Rawalakot that protesters had blockaded for days.</s> <s>Activists of a banned rights committee had shut the Arja–Rawalakot route after a trader was allegedly beaten on the first of July.</s> <s>This corner of Kashmir, usually seen only through the India–Pakistan lens, carries its own long history of protest over local grievances.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Across the border in India, at least eight people died and one remains buried after a heap at the Moshi dump collapsed onto a waste-to-energy office near Pune.</s> <s>Monsoon rains had loosened an informal workplace built on unstable landfill overseen by the Pimpri-Chinchwad municipal corporation.</s> <s>Rescuers with excavators and dog squads are still searching for the last missing worker.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Poland's Prime Minister Donald Tusk has pledged a national memorial to the roughly one hundred thousand ethnic Poles killed by Ukrainian nationalists between nineteen forty-three and nineteen forty-five.</s> <s>Warsaw stripped Ukraine's president of its highest honour last month after Kyiv named a military unit for the insurgent group blamed for those killings.</s> <s>Tusk has tied formal recognition of the massacre as genocide to Ukraine's path toward European Union membership.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Ukrainian drones struck twenty-one Russian oil tankers overnight, part of a campaign now reaching deep into Moscow's refineries and export fleet.</s> <s>Russia is exploiting a shortage of Patriot interceptors to strike Kyiv and Odesa in return.</s> <s>President Zelensky is pressing NATO to deliver the eighty billion dollars pledged at last week's Ankara summit.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Gaza, a father named Osama Al-Shafi carried his small son toward Israeli gunfire along the line the army calls yellow.</s> <s>His family says months of siege and the killing of his horse had broken his mind before he wandered toward the soldiers.</s> <s>His boy Jawad, just twenty-two months old, now wakes at night repeating three words... bang, blood, tank.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Panama's dollarized economy and the Colón Free Zone, one of the world's largest contraband markets, let Colombian and Mexican trafficking networks wash drug money through legitimate shipping.</s> <s>Investigators at InSight Crime found that trade-based laundering can turn a genuine free-trade hub into illicit-finance infrastructure.</s> <s>Authorities arrested twenty-five people on the seventh of July, yet the oversight gap in global commerce remains wide open.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Turkey, holding the COP31 presidency, has set a target for ninety percent of businesses to reach full electrification by twenty thirty-five.</s> <s>The goal is modeled to shield ordinary citizens from exactly the kind of energy price shock the Hormuz closure now threatens.</s> <s>Whether formal negotiations endorse it, after Brazil and Ethiopia's earlier presidencies, is still uncertain.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Canada's long-delayed Gordie Howe International Bridge, worth four and a half billion dollars, will finally open on the twenty-seventh of July.</s> <s>Trump had blocked the opening as leverage over Ottawa, while the owners of a rival crossing had given a million dollars to his political action committee.</s> <s>Residents living beside the new bridge say they still don't trust that it will open as promised.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Nearly a quarter of Dutch honeybee colonies did not survive last winter, with the northern province of Groningen losing more than forty percent.</s> <s>It's the fourth straight year losses have topped twenty percent, pointing to a worsening collapse rather than one harsh season.</s> <s>Beekeepers named no single cause, leaving mites, pesticides, and vanishing forage unresolved before the cold returns.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Palaeontologists in Thailand's Kalasin province have named a new long-necked dinosaur, Uragasaurus kalasinensis, that walked the earth about a hundred and fifty million years ago.</s> <s>A scanned vertebra placed the twenty-metre herbivore in a family known almost only from China until now.</s> <s>Published in Nature this week, the find opens a rare window onto how these giants dispersed across ancient Southeast Asia.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Uganda has recorded no new Ebola cases for nearly three weeks, a signal that its Sudan-strain outbreak has been brought under control.</s> <s>A Russian public-health team has now withdrawn, crediting donated mobile laboratories and the Ugandan staff it had trained.</s> <s>The episode is also a quiet contest over who provides epidemic aid across the African continent.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Venezuela, four thousand three hundred and thirty-three people are now confirmed dead after twin earthquakes flattened the coastal state of La Guaira on the twenty-fourth of June.</s> <s>Caracas is demanding the release of thirty tons of its gold, frozen in Britain, to fund the recovery.</s> <s>The United Nations is seeking two hundred and ninety-six million dollars, while London has still not answered the request.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Older adults in China increasingly know that the AI-generated singers, children, and virtual lovers they watch are entirely fabricated, and they choose to watch anyway.</s> <s>The companionship these synthetic figures offer seems to outweigh the users' full awareness that none of it is real.</s> <s>Platforms built these tools to capture attention, not to comfort the lonely, leaving that comfort strangely unaccountable.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>OpenAI says its latest model, called Sol Ultra, has produced a written proof of the Cycle Double Cover Conjecture, a question in graph theory left open for decades.</s> <s>The claim drew hundreds of votes online, yet no mathematician or proof-checking assistant has confirmed it.</s> <s>Until the work is independently verified, it stays an assertion... the difference between a machine that reasons and one that merely persuades.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>